WEBVTT

00:15.510 --> 00:16.110
Pull over.

00:17.000 --> 00:18.070
At the intersection ahead,

00:18.070 --> 00:19.270
just pull over there.

00:20.550 --> 00:20.920
Okay.

00:23.760 --> 00:25.090
Let me drive you inside.

00:25.270 --> 00:25.730
No need.

00:25.800 --> 00:26.770
It's hard to turn around inside.

00:26.770 --> 00:28.570
Just leave straight from there.

00:28.600 --> 00:30.170
Chief, take care on your way home.

00:30.170 --> 00:30.700
Okay.

00:31.320 --> 00:31.980
Drive safe.

00:34.810 --> 00:35.170
Go on.

02:17.090 --> 02:20.910
[Born with Luck]

02:20.930 --> 02:23.890
[Episode 3]

02:39.680 --> 02:41.540
Who changed the plan for tonight?

02:43.520 --> 02:44.320
What's wrong?

02:46.190 --> 02:48.280
It used to be inspections
in the downtown area.

02:48.280 --> 02:50.250
Now it's citywide checkpoints.

02:50.470 --> 02:52.120
All the police forces have been deployed.

02:52.120 --> 02:53.579
What are they trying to do?

02:55.840 --> 02:56.960
Bring up the scene.

03:00.500 --> 03:00.760
[August 23, 2012]

03:00.780 --> 03:01.750
[Smart Traffic Service Platform]
[Sanjiangkou Police Station]

03:03.800 --> 03:04.530
Chief Zhang,

03:05.060 --> 03:06.170
look for yourself.

03:07.760 --> 03:09.210
[Smart Traffic Service Platform]
[Sanjiangkou Police Station]

03:12.720 --> 03:14.930
[Wenjing Road] [Sujiang Road]
[Sanjiang Road]

03:15.520 --> 03:16.650
Whose idea was this?

03:19.280 --> 03:19.810
Mine.

03:20.590 --> 03:21.390
It was my idea.

03:22.520 --> 03:23.750
I thought the previous plan

03:23.750 --> 03:24.680
only targeted

03:24.800 --> 03:26.220
key areas and roads.

03:27.079 --> 03:28.280
Drunk drivers

03:28.400 --> 03:29.820
are drunk, not stupid.

03:29.910 --> 03:31.170
They can take a detour.

03:31.710 --> 03:32.560
The current plan

03:32.560 --> 03:33.560
is a bit messy,

03:34.590 --> 03:36.390
but the effect is quite obvious.

03:38.710 --> 03:39.480
Chief Zhang,

03:40.310 --> 03:41.280
the previous plan

03:41.280 --> 03:43.030
was based on our manpower.

03:43.630 --> 03:44.880
Your plan

03:46.360 --> 03:47.090
is very good.

03:49.870 --> 03:51.329
But there is a problem now.

03:51.800 --> 03:52.960
Many people are stuck on the road

03:52.960 --> 03:53.970
and can't go home.

03:54.430 --> 03:55.430
How do we solve it?

04:15.870 --> 04:17.560
The answer is in the question.

04:22.190 --> 04:22.920
I got it.

04:23.920 --> 04:25.980
This is the effect Chief Zhang wants.

04:26.870 --> 04:27.560
Even if it causes

04:27.560 --> 04:28.710
a day of hardship,

04:29.510 --> 04:30.720
we must serve a warning

04:30.720 --> 04:32.120
and deter drunk drivers.

04:34.510 --> 04:36.840
This way, they won't dare to
risk it again.

04:39.250 --> 04:40.510
Captain Wang, what do you think?

04:40.510 --> 04:41.020
I...

04:41.120 --> 04:41.920
My opinion doesn't matter.

04:41.920 --> 04:42.850
You're the boss.

04:45.360 --> 04:46.110
As they say,

04:46.360 --> 04:47.680
"Tears for your family,

04:47.680 --> 04:49.080
and blood for yourself."

04:49.680 --> 04:51.280
We must take this seriously.

04:52.630 --> 04:53.640
We might even find out

04:53.640 --> 04:54.570
something else.

05:07.830 --> 05:08.560
Ninety.

05:09.310 --> 05:10.250
Ninety-one.

05:11.040 --> 05:11.770
Ninety-two.

05:12.630 --> 05:13.630
Ninety-three.

05:14.630 --> 05:15.600
Ninety-four.

05:17.160 --> 05:18.480
N-Ninety-five.

05:19.270 --> 05:20.600
N-Ninety-six.

05:21.440 --> 05:22.640
Ninety-seven.

05:23.550 --> 05:24.480
Ninety-eight.

05:25.070 --> 05:26.030
Ninety-nine.

05:26.560 --> 05:27.380
One hundred.

05:55.840 --> 05:58.580
♪ The stars twinkle, the moon curves ♪

05:58.950 --> 05:59.930
Drive safe!

06:02.560 --> 06:07.210
♪ The breeze blows the willow tree tips ♪

06:15.950 --> 06:16.560
Bro.

06:16.870 --> 06:17.310
Brake.

06:18.720 --> 06:19.650
Don't worry.

06:23.830 --> 06:24.390
Hey,

06:24.720 --> 06:25.700
brake.

06:29.390 --> 06:30.240
Brake!

06:30.480 --> 06:31.360
I can't brake!

06:31.430 --> 06:33.190
Brake, bro!

07:19.000 --> 07:19.800
Piece of junk.

07:19.920 --> 07:21.190
Selling us this scrapped car

07:21.190 --> 07:22.270
for 25,000.

07:23.390 --> 07:24.880
It's practically a crime.

07:25.750 --> 07:27.210
What's wrong with a crime?

07:29.720 --> 07:31.380
Committing crimes is our job.

07:32.870 --> 07:34.480
Others can look down on us.

07:35.360 --> 07:36.120
But we must never

07:36.120 --> 07:37.510
look down on ourselves.

08:07.070 --> 08:09.130
Supply and demand dictate the price.

08:09.430 --> 08:10.190
In recent years, the police

08:10.190 --> 08:12.390
have cracked down hard on illegal cars.

08:12.870 --> 08:14.360
It's hard now to bypass procedures

08:14.360 --> 08:16.690
and buy an illegal car
with all the papers.

08:17.070 --> 08:18.730
This junk is only worth 5,000.

08:18.870 --> 08:21.000
The other 20,000 is for the documents.

08:21.720 --> 08:23.320
But this money must be spent.

08:24.130 --> 08:25.090
Otherwise, if the police

08:25.090 --> 08:26.120
find our car in the future

08:26.120 --> 08:27.120
and track it down,

08:27.630 --> 08:28.240
won't they discover

08:28.240 --> 08:29.340
that we bought it?

08:30.430 --> 08:32.429
We need to begin with the end in mind.

08:33.030 --> 08:34.120
Our main goal in coming to Sanjiangkou

08:34.120 --> 08:34.870
is ultimately

08:34.870 --> 08:36.330
to rob a corrupt official.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.150
We can't skimp on the necessary

08:38.150 --> 08:39.750
preliminary preparations.

08:41.720 --> 08:42.510
Right now,

08:43.270 --> 08:43.789
we're just counting on

08:43.789 --> 08:46.110
robbing a big corrupt official
to break even.

08:46.110 --> 08:46.930
I thought

08:47.200 --> 08:48.030
the gold we robbed

08:48.030 --> 08:49.550
and that God of Wealth statue

08:49.550 --> 08:50.510
would be worth at least

08:50.510 --> 08:51.790
a million.

08:52.630 --> 08:53.970
That bastard Zheng

08:54.000 --> 08:55.910
only gave us 80,000.

08:56.600 --> 08:57.670
He told us that right now,

08:57.670 --> 08:59.530
stolen goods are hard to launder.

08:59.600 --> 09:01.670
Does gold need to be laundered?

09:02.120 --> 09:03.850
Just melt it down and it's done!

09:04.540 --> 09:06.150
He'd better hope I don't run into him.

09:06.150 --> 09:08.010
If I do, I'll definitely kill him.

09:09.200 --> 09:10.000
The money he scammed from us

09:10.000 --> 09:10.720
will return doubled

09:10.720 --> 09:12.150
before long.

09:13.270 --> 09:14.720
After we rob the corrupt official,

09:14.720 --> 09:16.200
everything other than cash

09:16.200 --> 09:18.720
still needs to be
brought to Zheng to be liquidated.

09:18.720 --> 09:19.980
Then we'll take him out

09:20.290 --> 09:21.710
and get our stuff back.

09:22.270 --> 09:23.360
This way, we get the money

09:23.360 --> 09:24.760
and still have the stuff.

09:25.440 --> 09:27.170
Doesn't that double the value?

09:29.960 --> 09:31.240
That makes sense.

09:32.270 --> 09:33.150
Then,

09:33.240 --> 09:35.500
we'll find another collector next time,

09:36.910 --> 09:38.570
and do exactly the same thing.

09:39.000 --> 09:40.550
We give him the stuff,

09:41.150 --> 09:42.690
get the money,

09:43.120 --> 09:44.840
then go back, take him out,

09:45.670 --> 09:47.060
and get the stuff back.

09:47.670 --> 09:49.330
Doesn't that double it again?

09:49.480 --> 09:49.840
Bro,

09:50.440 --> 09:53.570
it'll be like we robbed
the corrupt official four times.

09:56.230 --> 09:57.970
Your math is excellent.

09:58.320 --> 10:00.380
No wonder you can't find a proper job.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.200
Why don't we just take out

10:05.200 --> 10:06.120
that bastard who just sold us the car,

10:06.120 --> 10:07.450
and be done with it, bro?

10:09.790 --> 10:11.480
You really are excellent.

10:18.560 --> 10:19.520
Hey, man.

10:19.870 --> 10:21.150
Did I just give you 20,000

10:21.150 --> 10:22.150
or 25,000?

10:23.790 --> 10:24.120
No.

10:24.120 --> 10:26.050
Why do I still have 5,000 left here?

10:27.320 --> 10:28.520
Okay, come and get it.

10:28.950 --> 10:30.150
We haven't gone far.

10:30.550 --> 10:31.670
Go past the first traffic light,

10:31.670 --> 10:32.510
keep going,

10:32.630 --> 10:34.090
and turn right at the fork.

10:34.720 --> 10:35.920
Okay, see you in a bit.

10:36.490 --> 10:39.010
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

10:39.840 --> 10:41.130
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

10:42.710 --> 10:45.220
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

10:46.240 --> 10:47.420
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

10:59.000 --> 11:00.930
This is a perfect place for murder.

11:25.320 --> 11:25.850
I'm here.

11:25.910 --> 11:26.710
Where are you?

11:29.470 --> 11:30.200
Walk inside.

11:50.120 --> 11:50.850
By the river.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.240
Wait a minute.

12:40.030 --> 12:40.630
Murder!

12:41.000 --> 12:41.670
Murder!

12:41.910 --> 12:42.480
How does he know

12:42.480 --> 12:43.480
about the murder?

12:44.200 --> 12:44.990
Murder!

12:48.150 --> 12:49.210
He sees the future?

13:02.200 --> 13:02.910
Run!

13:21.440 --> 13:21.970
Chief Qi.

13:22.960 --> 13:23.510
Where is it?

13:23.510 --> 13:24.170
Over there.

13:34.080 --> 13:34.550
Who's that?

13:34.550 --> 13:35.000
A car dealer.

13:35.000 --> 13:36.320
You reported the case, right?

13:36.320 --> 13:37.580
He's a used car dealer.

13:37.870 --> 13:39.480
Ye was killed last night.

13:39.840 --> 13:40.510
His transaction was scheduled

13:40.510 --> 13:41.360
for this morning.

13:41.360 --> 13:42.080
The time doesn't add up.

13:42.080 --> 13:43.270
He shouldn't be the killer.

13:43.270 --> 13:44.390
You must investigate it thoroughly.

13:44.390 --> 13:45.120
Understood.

13:46.440 --> 13:46.980
Chen!

13:48.030 --> 13:48.600
Chief Qi,

13:49.320 --> 13:50.270
evidence collection is complete.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.270
You can come over.

14:16.270 --> 14:17.270
You guys carry on.

14:18.830 --> 14:19.960
Who has a cigarette?

14:21.360 --> 14:22.290
Got a cigarette?

14:22.880 --> 14:24.050
Do any of you have a cigarette?

14:24.050 --> 14:25.510
Chief Qi, didn't you quit?

14:25.510 --> 14:27.040
I asked who has a cigarette!

14:27.240 --> 14:28.170
I have some here.

14:50.150 --> 14:50.680
Bro.

15:02.270 --> 15:04.330
He has a sharp tongue but a soft heart.

15:06.600 --> 15:07.330
You must have

15:08.910 --> 15:10.170
experienced this too.

15:12.000 --> 15:12.630
He's a...

15:13.790 --> 15:15.320
A straightforward person.

15:15.320 --> 15:15.720
Come.

15:20.840 --> 15:21.550
We might

15:21.600 --> 15:23.260
not have become good friends,

15:24.600 --> 15:26.660
but we should've been good partners.

15:29.270 --> 15:30.530
Don't take it to heart.

15:31.120 --> 15:32.720
He was like this to everyone.

15:32.980 --> 15:35.240
Actually, he was the hardest on himself.

15:35.550 --> 15:36.840
He told me

15:36.870 --> 15:38.070
many times to my face.

15:40.360 --> 15:41.270
If he grew old

15:42.150 --> 15:43.120
and had tubes going in and out of him,

15:43.120 --> 15:43.870
lying in a hospital bed,

15:43.870 --> 15:45.870
he wouldn't accept dying like that.

15:46.390 --> 15:47.510
For him, the most perfect way to die

15:47.510 --> 15:48.050
would be

15:48.440 --> 15:49.900
cracking the hardest case

15:50.240 --> 15:51.440
in the world,

15:51.720 --> 15:52.440
and catching

15:52.440 --> 15:53.970
the most cunning criminal.

15:54.240 --> 15:55.840
Then he would laugh out loud,

15:56.030 --> 15:57.430
and pass away instantly.

16:01.360 --> 16:02.690
Passed away instantly.

16:08.150 --> 16:09.350
He shall grow not old,

16:11.390 --> 16:13.320
as we that are left grow old.

16:17.510 --> 16:18.200
Age

16:21.790 --> 16:23.260
shall not weary him.

16:24.030 --> 16:26.560
At the going down of the sun
and in the morning,

16:26.790 --> 16:27.990
we will remember him.

16:34.480 --> 16:35.280
Take him away.

16:38.670 --> 16:39.590
Gently.

16:39.840 --> 16:40.300
Gently.

16:43.180 --> 16:44.050
Wait a moment.

16:53.850 --> 16:54.410
Come.

16:59.200 --> 16:59.660
Yi'ang,

17:01.440 --> 17:02.240
you're new,

17:02.840 --> 17:04.030
but you are the deputy director

17:04.030 --> 17:04.630
of the CID.

17:05.030 --> 17:06.890
You have to do everything you can,

17:07.400 --> 17:08.530
search high and low,

17:09.240 --> 17:10.970
to bring the killer to justice.

17:11.880 --> 17:12.920
I will do my best.

17:20.720 --> 17:21.250
Chief Qi.

17:22.349 --> 17:23.180
I found this

17:23.220 --> 17:24.150
under Ye's body.

17:26.920 --> 17:27.520
What is it?

17:29.200 --> 17:30.460
A name is written on it.

17:30.920 --> 17:31.440
A name?

17:32.310 --> 17:33.550
It is highly likely that Ye left

17:33.550 --> 17:34.310
the killer's name.

17:34.310 --> 17:34.910
What is it?

17:36.510 --> 17:37.850
[Yi'ang]

17:36.550 --> 17:37.200
Your name.

17:43.850 --> 17:45.620
[Yi'ang]

17:52.650 --> 17:53.410
He...

17:53.510 --> 17:55.170
He didn't write Zhang Yi'ang.

17:55.920 --> 17:56.480
And right now,

17:56.480 --> 17:57.240
we can't be sure

17:57.240 --> 17:58.840
if this is Ye's handwriting.

17:59.550 --> 18:00.160
Chief Qi,

18:00.920 --> 18:02.650
whether it's Ye's handwriting

18:02.960 --> 18:04.820
still needs to be authenticated.

18:05.110 --> 18:06.490
Could the killer have written it

18:06.490 --> 18:07.400
to frame you?

18:08.590 --> 18:09.110
Chen,

18:10.070 --> 18:12.130
what is Ye's estimated time of death?

18:13.270 --> 18:14.110
Preliminary assessment

18:14.110 --> 18:15.880
is that it was between
11 P.M. and midnight

18:15.880 --> 18:17.350
last night.

18:17.720 --> 18:19.250
Where were you at this time?

18:23.400 --> 18:24.930
Last night, Li Qian drove me

18:25.400 --> 18:26.350
at 10:30 P.M.

18:26.350 --> 18:27.030
from work

18:27.030 --> 18:27.900
to my home.

18:30.850 --> 18:33.110
Chief, it's very convenient
to take a taxi.

18:33.110 --> 18:34.310
Why spend that money?

18:34.360 --> 18:35.160
You drive me home,

18:35.160 --> 18:36.150
then take my car.

18:36.590 --> 18:37.290
Don't waste money.

18:37.290 --> 18:38.420
Save up when you can.

18:52.240 --> 18:53.170
That's correct.

18:54.290 --> 18:54.820
And then?

18:58.400 --> 19:00.020
Then I used my phone at home

19:00.160 --> 19:00.720
to order takeout

19:00.720 --> 19:02.380
from Wangzuo Malaban.

19:02.590 --> 19:03.920
It was delivered at 11:30 P.M.

19:03.920 --> 19:05.520
I went to sleep after eating.

19:07.000 --> 19:07.730
Verify this.

19:08.030 --> 19:08.560
Yes, sir.

19:12.880 --> 19:13.540
Don't rush.

19:15.200 --> 19:16.260
Make sure to figure

19:17.550 --> 19:18.400
everything out.

19:18.400 --> 19:18.930
Yes, sir.

19:25.090 --> 19:28.030
[Loyalty]

19:36.550 --> 19:38.150
Why would my name be written?

19:39.750 --> 19:41.510
Even if Ye had an issue with me,

19:42.200 --> 19:43.510
he shouldn't hold onto internal conflicts

19:43.510 --> 19:44.680
at a time like this.

19:45.550 --> 19:47.210
It indeed doesn't make sense.

19:49.240 --> 19:51.100
You just arrived in Sanjiangkou.

19:51.110 --> 19:52.640
Speaking of internal conflicts,

19:52.640 --> 19:54.170
you're the one benefiting,

19:54.790 --> 19:56.720
so you have no motive for the crime.

19:59.000 --> 20:00.730
If you were the one lying there,

20:00.920 --> 20:02.520
and wrote Captain Ye's name,

20:02.880 --> 20:05.010
that would actually be quite logical.

20:10.000 --> 20:10.360
I...

20:10.400 --> 20:12.350
I'm just speculating, hypothetically.

20:12.350 --> 20:12.880
No offense.

20:12.880 --> 20:14.070
None taken.

20:14.990 --> 20:15.720
I kind of wish

20:15.720 --> 20:17.070
I was the one lying there,

20:17.070 --> 20:17.830
and you all were here speculating

20:17.830 --> 20:19.290
about what happened to me.

20:20.830 --> 20:21.390
Chief!

20:22.830 --> 20:23.480
What is it?

20:23.720 --> 20:24.200
The person who delivered

20:24.200 --> 20:26.200
your food yesterday has been found.

20:26.640 --> 20:27.160
Found?

20:27.240 --> 20:27.860
Yes.

20:28.000 --> 20:29.160
You really found them?

20:29.160 --> 20:29.750
Are you sure?

20:29.750 --> 20:30.160
Yes.

20:35.110 --> 20:35.940
Thank you, Song.

20:35.940 --> 20:36.850
It's my job.

20:37.400 --> 20:37.790
I...

20:38.480 --> 20:39.070
Thank you.

20:39.030 --> 20:40.460
[Police]

20:39.200 --> 20:39.880
Good.

20:40.510 --> 20:41.590
Good. I'm glad it's found.

20:41.030 --> 20:46.990
[Police]

20:45.070 --> 20:45.870
I'm fine here.

20:45.960 --> 20:47.220
You can go back to work.

20:47.400 --> 20:48.540
I'll contact that person now

20:48.540 --> 20:50.670
to come to the station for a statement.

20:51.200 --> 20:51.800
Thank you.

20:54.880 --> 20:55.570
Chief.

20:55.880 --> 20:57.960
We found the witness
who delivered your meal.

20:57.960 --> 21:00.220
You're cleared of suspicion now, right?

21:01.920 --> 21:03.180
Will we still look into

21:03.270 --> 21:04.330
Captain Ye's case?

21:14.000 --> 21:15.820
Though I am in the clutch

21:16.160 --> 21:17.160
of circumstance,

21:18.000 --> 21:19.890
I thank whatever gods may be

21:20.510 --> 21:22.040
for my unconquerable soul.

21:24.030 --> 21:24.830
I understand.

21:25.000 --> 21:25.890
You mean

21:26.550 --> 21:28.480
you want to investigate to the end.

21:32.640 --> 21:33.560
How did you

21:33.590 --> 21:34.590
get that meaning?

21:35.270 --> 21:36.240
Weren't you just reciting

21:36.240 --> 21:38.070
William Ernest Henley's poem?

21:39.070 --> 21:41.310
I remember the next lines are:

21:42.070 --> 21:44.640
Under the bludgeonings of chance,

21:45.920 --> 21:47.920
my head is bloody, but unbowed.

21:49.310 --> 21:50.440
My body is battered,

21:51.510 --> 21:52.640
my soul is bruised,

21:53.880 --> 21:55.030
but I am unafraid.

21:59.510 --> 22:00.640
Those are the lines.

22:01.680 --> 22:03.210
Chief, let's analyze this.

22:03.880 --> 22:05.510
Captain Ye

22:06.160 --> 22:08.590
didn't have this accident
at any other time.

22:08.590 --> 22:09.550
He was murdered

22:09.550 --> 22:11.390
right when you took office.

22:12.480 --> 22:14.970
And you clearly came down here

22:15.160 --> 22:16.790
with the task of investigating

22:16.790 --> 22:17.720
Chief Lu's case.

22:18.640 --> 22:19.720
Is it possible

22:21.720 --> 22:23.170
that Captain Ye's murder

22:23.790 --> 22:25.590
is connected to Chief Lu's case?

22:29.200 --> 22:31.160
That's a very bold analysis.

22:33.510 --> 22:34.270
But I suggest

22:34.270 --> 22:36.210
we shouldn't be so bold right now.

22:37.030 --> 22:37.510
Chief,

22:38.000 --> 22:38.960
we need to go through

22:38.960 --> 22:39.880
all the criminal cases handled

22:39.880 --> 22:40.920
in the year before Chief Lu died,

22:40.920 --> 22:41.690
one by one,

22:42.030 --> 22:43.350
to see if there are any clues.

22:43.350 --> 22:44.350
What do you think?

22:44.750 --> 22:45.440
I think...

22:46.510 --> 22:47.480
we can.

22:47.480 --> 22:48.480
We can take a look.

22:49.480 --> 22:50.550
It's just that I have a lot

22:50.550 --> 22:51.160
on my plate right now.

22:51.160 --> 22:53.160
Don't worry about it. I'll go check.

22:54.480 --> 22:56.010
Thank you for your efforts.

23:00.240 --> 23:01.300
At such a young age,

23:01.460 --> 23:03.120
why do you read so much poetry?

23:06.020 --> 23:09.070
[Reason for borrowing: case investigation]
[Name: Ye Jian]

23:16.170 --> 23:17.550
[Criminal Investigation File]

23:21.200 --> 23:22.060
All filled out?

23:24.750 --> 23:25.760
Captain Ye

23:25.790 --> 23:27.200
also came to review files yesterday?

23:27.200 --> 23:27.510
Yes.

23:28.880 --> 23:30.480
What kind of cases were they?

23:30.640 --> 23:31.720
Cases Chief Lu was involved in

23:31.720 --> 23:33.030
the year before he passed away.

23:33.030 --> 23:34.360
They're all right here.

23:35.160 --> 23:35.690
Thanks.

23:39.550 --> 23:40.300
Li Qian.

23:41.790 --> 23:42.890
I was looking for you.

23:42.890 --> 23:44.220
What's wrong, Chief Qi?

23:48.110 --> 23:48.680
Yi'ang,

23:48.960 --> 23:49.960
come, have a seat.

24:00.750 --> 24:02.880
The trace inspection results are out.

24:02.920 --> 24:04.550
The small stone used for writing

24:04.550 --> 24:05.680
only had

24:05.750 --> 24:07.680
Ye's blood and fingerprints on it.

24:07.680 --> 24:08.310
Around the body,

24:08.310 --> 24:10.270
there were no biological traces
of anyone else.

24:10.270 --> 24:10.720
So,

24:11.830 --> 24:12.670
your name

24:13.510 --> 24:15.480
could only have been written by Ye himself

24:15.480 --> 24:16.680
right before he died.

24:20.640 --> 24:21.970
There's another thing.

24:22.240 --> 24:23.420
Why did you

24:23.880 --> 24:25.550
order food from Wangzuo Malaban?

24:25.550 --> 24:26.280
That place is

24:26.350 --> 24:27.750
seven or eight kilometers away

24:27.750 --> 24:28.880
from where you live.

24:30.160 --> 24:31.020
It tastes good.

24:31.590 --> 24:32.910
Well... what's wrong?

24:33.350 --> 24:34.080
Chief Zhang,

24:34.480 --> 24:36.270
the woman who delivered your food,

24:36.270 --> 24:36.960
Jiang Ying,

24:38.030 --> 24:39.030
has gone missing.

24:39.880 --> 24:40.640
Missing?

24:42.640 --> 24:43.920
After the police went to the restaurant

24:43.920 --> 24:45.250
and confirmed with her,

24:45.720 --> 24:46.720
I wanted her to come to the bureau

24:46.720 --> 24:48.400
so we could ask a few questions.

24:48.400 --> 24:49.800
But when I called her,

24:50.270 --> 24:52.130
her phone was already turned off.

24:53.750 --> 24:54.350
Missing?

25:03.240 --> 25:03.760
What,

25:03.930 --> 25:05.400
are you suspecting that I

25:05.510 --> 25:06.570
arranged for...

25:07.310 --> 25:08.170
a fake witness?

25:23.920 --> 25:24.980
Some comrades here

25:26.350 --> 25:28.000
might have some feelings against me,

25:28.000 --> 25:28.590
or even

25:29.200 --> 25:30.310
be unwilling to cooperate with my work.

25:30.310 --> 25:31.570
I can understand that.

25:31.830 --> 25:32.590
But everything

25:32.590 --> 25:34.120
has its limits, doesn't it?

25:34.200 --> 25:35.390
If someone is

25:35.790 --> 25:38.320
intentionally spreading rumors
to frame me,

25:39.680 --> 25:40.940
I cannot forgive that.

25:42.480 --> 25:44.280
What really makes us suspicious

25:45.270 --> 25:46.270
is her testimony.

25:55.260 --> 25:55.880
Li Qian.

26:07.070 --> 26:07.800
Chief Zhang,

26:08.640 --> 26:09.690
last night,

26:10.310 --> 26:11.310
I only dropped you off

26:11.310 --> 26:13.370
at the intersection near your house.

26:14.350 --> 26:16.480
Whether you actually went home or not,

26:17.120 --> 26:17.600
I...

26:19.400 --> 26:20.400
truly don't know.

26:43.740 --> 26:44.470
Chief Zhang.

26:45.550 --> 26:46.280
Chief Zhang.

26:48.720 --> 26:49.510
After that,

26:49.640 --> 26:50.920
you gave Ye a call,

26:50.960 --> 26:51.470
right?

26:52.310 --> 26:52.640
Yes,

26:52.720 --> 26:53.850
I did call him.

26:53.880 --> 26:55.120
Can I see your phone?

27:12.200 --> 27:13.160
At the time, why didn't you mention

27:13.010 --> 27:14.720
[Call Record] [Ye Jian]

27:13.640 --> 27:14.670
this detail?

27:21.240 --> 27:22.000
I forgot.

27:22.510 --> 27:23.710
I really just forgot.

27:24.160 --> 27:25.750
I made that call to Ye

27:27.270 --> 27:28.070
to have a talk with him.

27:28.070 --> 27:29.000
Talk about what?

27:30.550 --> 27:31.680
I just wanted to talk.

27:31.680 --> 27:32.700
Between us,

27:34.440 --> 27:35.990
there's no real conflict.

27:36.480 --> 27:37.030
We still have to

27:37.030 --> 27:38.350
work together in the future.

27:38.350 --> 27:39.790
I wanted to treat him to a meal.

27:39.790 --> 27:40.810
Treat him to a meal

27:40.960 --> 27:41.930
or have a talk?

27:47.400 --> 27:49.060
Chief Qi, what does this mean?

27:50.550 --> 27:52.400
Everyone just wants to understand

27:52.400 --> 27:54.000
the situation more clearly.

28:04.110 --> 28:04.640
Yi'ang,

28:04.830 --> 28:05.720
where are you going?

28:05.720 --> 28:06.400
I don't think you should

28:06.400 --> 28:07.590
get involved in this case, okay?

28:07.590 --> 28:09.650
I'll definitely stay out of the case.

28:10.070 --> 28:11.440
I need to find that delivery worker.

28:11.440 --> 28:12.640
Right now, only she can prove

28:12.640 --> 28:13.700
that I'm innocent.

28:15.550 --> 28:16.280
Is that okay?

28:18.350 --> 28:19.720
Don't just stand there.

28:19.790 --> 28:20.690
Go help look.

28:33.310 --> 28:35.620
[Police]

28:34.720 --> 28:35.250
Chief.

28:36.480 --> 28:36.960
Chief.

28:38.070 --> 28:38.730
Let me do it.

28:39.440 --> 28:40.000
Chief.

28:53.120 --> 28:53.740
Chief.

29:10.880 --> 29:11.490
Chief,

29:11.550 --> 29:12.810
where are we going now?

29:37.400 --> 29:39.050
Sorry, Song Xing.

29:39.440 --> 29:41.240
Chief, what's wrong?

29:42.480 --> 29:43.400
I shouldn't have said that

29:43.400 --> 29:44.800
to you upstairs just now.

29:45.550 --> 29:47.150
You don't need to apologize.

29:47.200 --> 29:47.880
You don't need to apologize

29:47.880 --> 29:49.680
no matter how you scold or hit me.

29:49.830 --> 29:51.040
As police,

29:51.350 --> 29:51.880
we should

29:51.880 --> 29:53.480
doubt the doubt of the doubt.

29:54.240 --> 29:55.450
I said that myself.

29:56.110 --> 29:57.070
You are right

29:58.030 --> 29:58.830
to suspect me.

30:25.400 --> 30:25.900
Chief.

30:28.480 --> 30:30.060
Since I became a policeman,

30:31.590 --> 30:32.720
in every meeting,

30:33.200 --> 30:34.380
I have been thinking actively

30:34.380 --> 30:35.440
and eager to speak.

30:35.960 --> 30:38.270
I've made at least
hundreds of suggestions.

30:38.270 --> 30:39.350
But Captain Ye and the others

30:39.350 --> 30:40.810
have never accepted them.

30:42.790 --> 30:43.920
At the very beginning,

30:43.920 --> 30:45.250
they still let me speak.

30:45.750 --> 30:46.350
Now,

30:46.350 --> 30:48.350
they don't even let me talk in meetings.

30:48.350 --> 30:48.880
I have no idea

30:48.880 --> 30:50.410
why they treat me like this.

30:51.200 --> 30:51.910
But you,

30:52.270 --> 30:53.330
you're different.

30:54.160 --> 30:55.590
About the joint DUI operation,

30:55.590 --> 30:56.310
I just went to you

30:56.310 --> 30:57.160
with the mindset of

30:57.160 --> 30:58.020
giving it a try.

30:58.400 --> 30:59.960
I didn't expect you to accept it

30:59.960 --> 31:01.560
without me even explaining.

31:02.920 --> 31:03.350
Later,

31:03.350 --> 31:04.920
when such a big thing happened,

31:04.920 --> 31:06.310
you still said I was right

31:06.310 --> 31:07.510
and that I helped you.

31:08.720 --> 31:09.980
What is appreciation?

31:10.350 --> 31:11.610
This is appreciation.

31:13.790 --> 31:14.380
Chief,

31:15.030 --> 31:16.360
when you said that,

31:16.480 --> 31:17.410
I made up my mind.

31:17.790 --> 31:19.990
I will follow you for the rest of my life.

31:29.990 --> 31:30.500
Xing,

31:31.440 --> 31:32.210
in my life,

31:32.630 --> 31:34.960
I have basically never misjudged anyone.

31:49.880 --> 31:51.060
Chief,

31:51.150 --> 31:52.420
when Chief Qi asked me,

31:52.480 --> 31:54.280
of course I had to tell the truth.

31:54.920 --> 31:56.200
I did only drop you off

31:56.240 --> 31:57.900
at the intersection that day.

31:58.800 --> 31:59.930
But for this matter,

32:00.750 --> 32:01.830
you just need to prove that

32:01.830 --> 32:02.640
it was impossible

32:02.640 --> 32:04.240
for you to be at the scene then.

32:04.240 --> 32:05.310
Then it'll be over.

32:07.270 --> 32:08.870
You are a veteran detective.

32:09.440 --> 32:11.310
So smart and experienced.

32:12.310 --> 32:13.070
For you,

32:13.070 --> 32:15.030
this must be very easy.

32:16.270 --> 32:16.880
I am not

32:16.880 --> 32:17.910
a show-off.

32:18.830 --> 32:19.700
Coming to Sanjiangkou,

32:19.700 --> 32:21.360
I should keep a lower profile.

32:21.830 --> 32:22.830
Now you are forcing me

32:22.830 --> 32:24.230
to rush to the front line.

32:24.880 --> 32:25.810
What should I do?

32:25.960 --> 32:27.270
Show off my skills to our comrades?

32:27.270 --> 32:28.590
-Just show us.
-Just show us.

32:28.590 --> 32:29.920
We really want to see it.

32:30.400 --> 32:31.550
Xing, stop driving in circles.

32:31.550 --> 32:32.750
I'm a little carsick.

32:34.200 --> 32:34.770
No,

32:35.070 --> 32:35.530
Chief.

32:35.560 --> 32:36.750
It's not that I'm driving in circles.

32:36.750 --> 32:37.310
You haven't told me

32:37.310 --> 32:38.370
where we are going.

32:39.480 --> 32:40.540
Where are we going?

32:40.590 --> 32:42.590
Wait a minute. I'm a little carsick.

32:42.590 --> 32:42.960
Okay.

32:49.220 --> 32:50.460
We found Jiang Ying's address.

32:50.460 --> 32:51.290
Follow me.

32:58.790 --> 32:59.270
Sir,

32:59.290 --> 33:00.750
what are you doing? Open the door.

33:00.750 --> 33:01.590
Going out?

33:01.750 --> 33:02.750
What do you think?

33:07.480 --> 33:08.210
This gate...

33:18.550 --> 33:23.020
[Yingzi General Store]

33:18.750 --> 33:19.640
Police!

33:19.790 --> 33:20.720
Is anyone there?

33:24.400 --> 33:25.600
How's the situation?

33:26.110 --> 33:26.510
Chief.

33:27.240 --> 33:29.300
I don't think there's anyone inside.

33:31.310 --> 33:32.310
Did you call them?

33:32.470 --> 33:34.330
Both their phones are turned off.

33:34.400 --> 33:36.260
Both their phones are turned off.

33:38.160 --> 33:38.830
Should we

33:38.830 --> 33:40.160
break the door open now?

33:41.680 --> 33:44.080
Chief Zhang is going to
break the door open.

33:49.550 --> 33:50.510
That's against protocol.

33:50.510 --> 33:51.480
They aren't criminals.

33:51.480 --> 33:52.640
We don't have a warrant.

33:52.640 --> 33:53.480
On what grounds can we break in?

33:53.480 --> 33:54.640
Who will take the blame
if something happens?

33:54.640 --> 33:55.310
Chief Qi said...

33:55.310 --> 33:56.770
I heard him. I heard it all.

34:01.000 --> 34:01.650
Look.

34:02.200 --> 34:03.160
When Captain Ye had his accident,

34:03.160 --> 34:04.270
this woman delivered food to me.

34:04.270 --> 34:04.670
Right?

34:04.720 --> 34:05.880
Now both of them have run away.

34:05.880 --> 34:06.790
Don't you find that suspicious?

34:06.790 --> 34:07.520
Suspicious.

34:07.830 --> 34:08.960
So do you agree to break in?

34:08.960 --> 34:09.800
I agree it's suspicious.

34:09.800 --> 34:10.920
But we need a warrant to force the door.

34:10.920 --> 34:11.840
With no warrant and no evidence,

34:11.840 --> 34:12.900
how can we break in?

34:13.480 --> 34:14.150
The evidence is inside.

34:14.150 --> 34:14.670
If I don't break in,

34:14.670 --> 34:15.400
how can I get the evidence?

34:15.400 --> 34:17.400
We can't break in without evidence.

34:20.370 --> 34:26.870
[Yingzi General Store]

34:41.880 --> 34:43.540
Chief Zhang has no solutions.

34:43.590 --> 34:44.510
He's helpless.

34:58.630 --> 34:59.330
I know

34:59.360 --> 35:00.320
I will be neglected

35:00.320 --> 35:01.850
in some corner of the world.

35:03.280 --> 35:03.960
The last remaining

35:03.960 --> 35:05.310
glimmer of light,

35:05.920 --> 35:07.260
at the end of life,

35:07.630 --> 35:08.680
will flicker

35:10.590 --> 35:11.790
and be extinguished.

35:13.070 --> 35:13.710
It's time

35:13.760 --> 35:15.890
for Chief Zhang's poetry recitation.

35:15.960 --> 35:16.820
Extinguished.

35:21.320 --> 35:22.050
Chief Zhang!

35:25.000 --> 35:25.730
Chief Zhang!

35:28.840 --> 35:30.040
This is the landlord.

35:31.360 --> 35:31.760
Hello.

35:31.760 --> 35:32.160
Hello.

35:32.550 --> 35:33.100
Ma'am,

35:33.670 --> 35:34.630
Jiang Ying, who lives here,

35:34.630 --> 35:35.590
is an important witness.

35:35.590 --> 35:36.480
Do you agree to let us

35:36.480 --> 35:38.630
to break the door open and investigate?

35:38.630 --> 35:39.410
No.

35:40.550 --> 35:42.010
Why do you need to break in?

35:44.030 --> 35:45.400
I have a key.

35:46.360 --> 35:47.360
Thank you, ma'am.

35:47.400 --> 35:48.670
Come on, turn on the body cams.

35:48.670 --> 35:49.110
Hurry up.

35:49.110 --> 35:49.710
Turn it on.

35:51.210 --> 35:54.780
[Police]

36:12.920 --> 36:14.030
Who is the person

36:14.070 --> 36:15.030
living with Jiang Ying?

36:15.030 --> 36:16.480
It's Jiang Ying's husband.

36:16.480 --> 36:17.880
I think his surname is Li.

36:18.000 --> 36:18.510
When they left,

36:18.510 --> 36:19.510
did they tell you?

36:19.710 --> 36:21.110
They didn't say anything.

36:21.110 --> 36:22.970
What could that couple have done?

36:23.440 --> 36:25.480
That man wouldn't even
dare to kill a chicken.

36:25.480 --> 36:26.670
The bedroom's in there?

36:26.670 --> 36:27.000
Yes.

36:47.030 --> 36:47.760
Chief Zhang.

36:50.000 --> 36:50.930
Hold this for me.

37:23.110 --> 37:24.440
The woman's height is between 1.60

37:24.440 --> 37:25.600
and 1.62 meters.

37:26.110 --> 37:27.590
She has a well-proportioned figure,

37:27.590 --> 37:29.450
weighs no more than 50 kilograms,

37:29.550 --> 37:30.680
and dresses neatly.

37:38.630 --> 37:39.500
She has fair skin

37:39.500 --> 37:40.720
and chestnut hair.

37:42.670 --> 37:43.760
Her footsteps?

37:43.780 --> 37:45.060
Light and fast.

37:48.340 --> 37:50.140
She speaks clearly and briskly.

37:50.440 --> 37:51.600
What about the man?

37:52.280 --> 37:53.210
I don't know about the man.

37:53.210 --> 37:54.940
How do you know about the woman?

37:55.070 --> 37:56.440
The woman delivered food to me.

37:56.440 --> 37:57.240
I've seen her.

37:59.070 --> 37:59.830
Here.

37:59.960 --> 38:01.150
Notify everyone immediately.

38:01.150 --> 38:02.550
Mobilize all police forces

38:02.550 --> 38:04.150
from surrounding towns
and police stations.

38:04.150 --> 38:06.070
Secure the bus and train stations,

38:06.070 --> 38:06.710
and all major entrances

38:06.710 --> 38:07.960
and exits of the city.

38:08.400 --> 38:09.670
Launch a citywide manhunt immediately.

38:09.670 --> 38:10.420
Tonight,

38:10.510 --> 38:11.190
we must catch them

38:11.190 --> 38:12.430
in Sanjiangkou.

38:12.490 --> 38:17.380
[Sanjiangkou Transportation Center]

38:30.550 --> 38:36.190
[Please keep one meter away]

38:56.250 --> 38:56.710
[Please keep one meter away]

38:57.050 --> 38:57.590
Let's go.

38:57.230 --> 39:01.550
[Please keep one meter away]

38:58.320 --> 39:00.320
A guy over there keeps looking at me.

39:00.510 --> 39:01.510
Could he be a cop?
